    LLM: 'Each trick: non-dealer leads any card. No follow-suit obligation. Opponent plays any card. Trick won by higher Briscola (trump) played, OR higher of led suit if no Briscola. Winner draws first from stock; loser draws second. Winner leads next. Final trick: trump indicator card is last taken from stock.',
    Player: 'Each trick: non-dealer leads any card. No follow-suit obligation. Opponent plays any card. Trick won by higher Briscola (trump) played, OR higher of led suit if no Briscola. Winner draws first from stock; loser draws second. Winner leads next. Final trick: trump indicator card is last taken from stock.',
